          "element_id": "CN-004",
          "section": "constraint",
          "text_label": "REST API requests use UTF-8 encoded JSON bodies. After UTF-8 decoding, JSON string values are used as received without Unicode normalization. A body with invalid UTF-8 or malformed JSON is rejected with HTTP 400, and a request with a media type other than application/json is rejected with HTTP 415."
        },
